<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 565.89, off 0.66.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 312 to 202.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,061,795, compared with 18,202,450 Monday.</p>
<p>		   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
